        "node_id": "n_7_3b1984",
        "thought_text": "Reformulate the problem using a binary search approach to find the minimum number of days. For each midpoint in the binary search, check if it's possible to accumulate at least p experience points and q dollars within that many days. This approach can efficiently narrow down the range of possible solutions.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-1037069630786981763",
